<title>FINLAND: Finnish 1996 real earnings rise 3.3 pct vs 1995.</title>
<headline>Finnish 1996 real earnings rise 3.3 pct vs 1995.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish real earnings rose a year-on-year 3.3 percent in 1996 and nominal wages rose 3.9 percent in the same period, Statistics Finland said on Monday.</p>
<p>In the final quarter of 1996, nominal wages rose an average 3.3 percent year-on-year and the real earnings index rose 2.5 percent.</p>
<p>The average monthly salary was 11,200 markka, Statistics Finland said in a statement .</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
